<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="policies" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Privacy, choices &amp; design rights</h1></header><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Your information</h2></div><p>For personal-data questions, email contact@suijijewelry.com. The final notice must identify the operating entity, purposes, processors and retention periods before new account, upload or AI services are enabled.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Cookie choices</h2></div><p>The live shop’s optional analytics and advertising choices are managed by its native consent interface. A local bag or design draft is separate from advertising consent. New upload and AI services are not enabled by these controls.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>References &amp; rights</h2></div><p>Inspiration is not permission to copy. Do not upload or request copies of unlicensed logos, characters, artworks or other jewelry designs. Taking a photo does not automatically give you rights to the design shown, and personal use does not guarantee that it is lawful.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Private, public and commercial</h2></div><p>It is not automatically published or sold. Private drafts, public voting and commercial sale require separate choices, with a further agreement for the exact commercial version and rights.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Handmade &amp; consumer rights</h2></div><p>Handmade variations do not remove our responsibility for the stated materials, key dimensions, function or applicable consumer rights.</p></section></div>
